ility-laws</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.6–11.4.7, print pp. 509–511; PDF pp. 531–533; explicit almost-sure interpretation of Las Vegas"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-definition-and-proof-compared; almost-sure-halting-clarification; local formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>输入字母表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的概率、期望按已列依赖；正确性和停机均按概率解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ZPP}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}\\;[\n\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(\\mathbb E_M(w)\\le c(|w|+1)^d\\land\n(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)=1)\\land\n(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^r(w)=1))]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ZPP}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}\\;[\n\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(\\mathbb E_M(w)\\le c(|w|+1)^d\\land\n(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)=1)\\land\n(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^r(w)=1))]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第三版 p.510 用“always halts”表述，随后定理 11.17 却用可能无限重试的几何循环。本条采用与该证明相容的“以概率一停机”，有限期望同时排除了正概率发散。逐条随机带都终止的要求更强，不能暗中用于几何循环证明；这一解释差异在本条前两节已固定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-acceptance-probability","status":"resolved","id":"49440e374bb38c72","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws","status":"resolved","id":"29f67a62b22dd6a8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ZPP}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}\\;[\n\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(\\mathbb E_M(w)\\le c(|w|+1)^d\\land\n(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)=1)\\land\n(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^r(w)=1))]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1743,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time|以概率一停机的零错误多项式期望时间]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"0afef8eeccddc023","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["49440e374bb38c72","29f67a62b22dd6a8"]}